Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-tk, curl, desktop-file-utils, fontconfig, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libdbus-1-3, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libgl1, libnss3, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxrandr2
Description: Independent Minecraft launcher for the BreakBlocks community
 BreakBlocks Launcher manages Minecraft instances, profiles, mods and the
 BreakBlocks community web chat from one desktop application.
